# "Strong" tier (docs/15 D-1) — Verifier, Critic, Synthesizer, Citation
# Validator. These nodes gate what ships (entailment judgement, adversarial
# review, final report writing), so quality is weighted over throughput.
#
# TODO (D-30, pre-V1): replace the tag below with a digest-pinned reference
# once the hardware benchmark picks the exact parameter size. See README.md.
FROM qwen3:32b

PARAMETER temperature 0.0
PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
